## Workspace Structure

```
/config/                    # Container home directory
├── workspace/              # Project files (${WORKSPACE_PATH})
│   ├── AGENTS.md           # This file
│   ├── CLAUDE.md           # Symlink → AGENTS.md (for Claude Code)
│   └── <projects>/         # User's projects
├── .ssh/                   # SSH keys
│   └── authorized_keys     # For SSH/Haven CLI access
├── .zshrc                  # User-owned shell config
└── .config/                # Tool configs and EnvHaven's managed credential store
```

